<title>UK: Schroder Unit Trusts to outsource admin to WM Co.</title>
<headline>Schroder Unit Trusts to outsource admin to WM Co.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Unit Trusts has appointed The WM Company to manage the investment administration for its 35 retail and institutional unit trusts, which hold assets of over 12 billion stg, WM said.</p>
<p>Schroders has confirmed that there will be no redundancies as a result of the move.</p>
<p>Earlier this year, WM won a contract to provide all of the investment administration work for the 22 billion stg asset portfolio of Scottish Widows.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Allen, London newsroom +44 171 542 6414</p>
</text>
